			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["54F5458D64A67BBB"]
			description: [
				"Give defenders clear routes, protected ranged positions and a rally point near the bell. Store shields, food, arrows and spare beds where new players can find them."
				"During a raid, stay together and search methodically for the final attackers. Do not sprint alone into caves or forest cover while the village remains exposed."
				"Afterwards, repair doors, lighting and terrain. Victory without reconstruction only postpones the next disaster."
				"Guard Villagers need clear routes, lighting, equipment, and a raid plan. Decorative walls are not protection if gates remain open, roofs spawn enemies, or villagers cannot retreat from the bell to safe beds."
			]
			id: "46911437BC86E339"
