		{
			dependencies: ["35046621C94B6A6D", "46911437BC86E339"]
			description: [
				"Zombie curing requires Weakness and a golden apple. Build a controlled clinic before attempting it, separate the patient from guards, and prevent sunlight or other mobs from ending the process."
				"Use curing to recover endangered villagers and improve a functioning community, not as an excuse to create uncontrolled infection beside everyone's home."
				"Name irreplaceable villagers and record their important trades so accidents can be understood and repaired."
				"Curing improves trade economics but requires controlled containment and safe handling. Prepare the weakness effect, golden apple, lighting, and exit before exposing a villager to infection."
			]
			id: "2B98C6D95CFCF5C0"
			rewards: [{
