		{
			dependencies: ["5EF9AC708BE10640"]
			description: [
				"Keep a modest public room with a bed, food, starter tools, a map and written directions. Do not fill it with overpowered gear that skips the pack's early lessons."
				"Place the quest-book instructions and server rules somewhere visible. A player should be able to recover from a bad first night without needing the host online."
				"The Chronicle calls this the Open Door: a settlement proves its strength by making arrival gentle."
				"A living settlement has public food, readable storage, professions, transport, defence, and room to grow. The Steward's Charter judges success by whether residents and new players can use the town without constant rescue."
			]
