		{
			dependencies: ["5EF9AC708BE10640"]
			description: [
				"Build a safe, marked route using terrain-friendly bridges, lights and rest points. If the distance is large, plan a waystone or Create rail station without erasing the journey entirely."
				"Name the route at both ends and update the map. Infrastructure only becomes shared when other players can understand it without an escort."
				"Leave nearby wild areas intact. A village connected to the world should not require flattening the world around it."
				"Guard Villagers need clear routes, lighting, equipment, and a raid plan. Decorative walls are not protection if gates remain open, roofs spawn enemies, or villagers cannot retreat from the bell to safe beds."
