		{
			description: [
				"Walk the village in daylight and record beds, workstations, farms, bells, paths, lighting, entrances, nearby caves, and the professions already present. Repair immediate danger before redesigning houses."
				"Do not break every job site at once. Villagers remember claims and schedules, so move one profession deliberately, confirm access and restocking, then continue after the settlement stabilises."
				"Preserve one local material, landmark, farm, or street pattern so the place remains recognisable to returning players. Stewardship improves a living system; it is not an excuse to flatten every village into the same trading hall."
			]
			id: "680215445DA0C27F"
			rewards: [{
