		{
			dependencies: ["680215445DA0C27F"]
			description: [
				"More Villagers adds professions and job sites that extend familiar trade logic. Search at-more_villargers in JEI, craft one workstation, and place it where an unemployed adult can safely path to it."
				"Observe the profession change and early trade table before locking trades. A villager must reach the claimed station to restock, and another villager may take the block if ownership becomes ambiguous."
				"Create a public profession school with one labelled example of each useful station instead of scattering unexplained blocks through houses. The room becomes both an economy and a tutorial."
			]
			id: "0BA84AFD5BCEC392"
			rewards: [{
