		{
			dependencies: ["22CC2FF8449941A3"]
			description: [
				"Guard Villagers can protect settlements, but they still depend on readable space. Clear doors and paths, light roofs and caves, secure the bell area, and give civilians a route to beds before adding more defenders."
				"Equip guards deliberately and keep replacement supplies in an armoury. Test gates and sightlines during an ordinary night rather than discovering during a raid that defenders cannot reach the wall."
				"Assign rally points for players, recovery food, spare bows, milk, blocks, and a safe place for valuable villagers. A raid plan should continue working when its original builder is offline."
			]
			id: "16DF4C52E4BAAD49"
			rewards: [{
				id: "2C6F85720CF0C05D"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
