			title: "Steward's Lesson: Equip the Guard"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 9.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["16DF4C52E4BAAD49"]
			description: [
				"Use the Trading Post to inspect accessible nearby trades without turning villagers into a hidden wall of identical cells. Confirm its range and keep the relevant villagers loaded, safe, and able to use their job sites."
				"Label valuable trades and the materials that sustain them. Farmers, librarians, tool workers, and added professions form an economy only when players understand what to bring and villagers can restock."
				"Keep cure discounts and rare offers public knowledge. The settlement's economy is strongest when a new player can participate rather than being told all useful trades belong to someone else's private basement."
			]
