		{
			dependencies: ["48BE4DDF821FDBCB"]
			description: [
				"Complete a public kitchen, profession area, trading point, guarded route, map or notice board, guest beds, and transport connection. Each space must be usable without opening a private storage room."
				"Write who maintains farms, how raids are announced, where recovered gear goes, and which materials are communal. Rules should protect cooperation without turning ordinary play into bureaucracy."
				"Invite a player who did not build the town to spend one Minecraft day using it. Their confusion becomes the final repair list; the charter is complete when the settlement teaches hospitality through its layout."
